  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="soft">Effective 19 November 2026</p>

  <p>This policy explains how we process personal data when you play Midnight Pantry, a game for iPhone and Android. It is the information we must give you under Articles 13 and 14 of the GDPR. The GDPR applies to every player, wherever you live, because we are based in Poland. The English and Polish versions have equal force.</p>

